Subject: [PATCH 12/52] E2E v1 harness: world generator, raw-event feed through
 connectors, task issuing (WP2)

Deterministic two-tenant worlds (S/M/L), raw local_export JSONL sources only, attached and synced
through the connector API into each holder; tasks issued as goals/questions through the HTTP API
as the asker; asker-view dumps for the isolated scorer. The holdout template bank is sealed outside
the repository tree (sha256 6613deee...5214) and loaded only from an explicit path at holdout time.
Engineer: WP2 (claude-sonnet-5-5).

